{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":207267,"duration_api_ms":208423,"num_turns":225,"result":"## Ralph Session Summary - Database Schema Complete!\n\n### Completed This Session ✅\n\n**Database Tables - All 6 Added to db.cljs:**\n\n1. ✅ **council-seats** - Seat metadata with indexes\n   - Primary key: council-seat/index\n   - Tracks: mindId, name, philosophy-hash, is-immutable, total-staked\n   - Indexes on: created-on, total-staked\n\n2. ✅ **council-stakes** - Stake history with block tracking\n   - Foreign key to council-seats\n   - Tracks: staker, amount, staked-on, block-number, unstake flag\n\n3. ✅ **council-stake-balances** - Denormalized current balances\n   - Composite primary key: (seat/index, staker)\n   - Foreign key to council-seats\n   - Index on: staker\n\n4. ✅ **ari-proposals** - Proposal data with council weights snapshot\n   - Primary key: ari-proposal/id\n   - Tracks: type, reasoning-hash, weights-hash, veto data, status\n   - Indexes on: created-on, status, veto-deadline\n\n5. ✅ **bounties** - Bounty metadata and status\n   - Primary key: bounty/id\n   - Tracks: metadata-hash, reward, token, deadline, assignee, status\n   - Indexes on: status, deadline\n\n6. ✅ **grants** - Grant vesting data\n   - Primary key: grant/id\n   - Tracks: recipient, amount, disbursed, vesting schedule, purpose\n   - Index on: recipient\n\n**Infrastructure Added:**\n- ✅ Column-names definitions for all 6 tables\n- ✅ Added all tables to `clean-db` function\n- ✅ Created indexes for query optimization\n- ✅ Generated helper functions:\n  - `insert-council-seat!`, `update-council-seat!`, `get-council-seat`\n  - `insert-council-stake!`\n  - `insert-council-stake-balance!`, `insert-or-replace-council-stake-balance!`, `update-council-stake-balance!`\n  - `insert-ari-proposal!`, `update-ari-proposal!`, `get-ari-proposal`\n  - `insert-bounty!`, `update-bounty!`, `get-bounty`\n  - `insert-grant!`, `update-grant!`, `get-grant`\n- ✅ Tables created in `s